subj name fizzbuzz line by num 0 to name text line be ceremony def
exists subj name line obj text quoted.text..text.quoted be text ya
exists subj name rem3 obj num 0 be number ya
exists subj name rem5 obj num 0 be number ya
obj this by from num 3 to name rem3 be remains do
obj this by from num 5 to name rem5 be remains do

obj name rem3 be equally from num 0 then obj text Fizz to name line be add do
obj name rem5 be equally from num 0 then obj text Buzz to name line be add do
obj name line be equally from text quoted.text..text.quoted then obj this by to name line be add do
obj name line ret
subj name fizzbuzz line be ceremony prah

subj name fizzbuzz say fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
exists subj name line obj text quoted.text..text.quoted be text ya
by num of fromindex of this to name line be fizzbuzz line do
obj name line be write do
